  "description": "Our top of the line Shift model with its new 4-Bar linkage frame design and 12mm rear thru-axle, delivers upgraded suspension adjustment options, lighter components, advanced technology and control. Faster, crispier shifting with a new side-swing front derailleur and smoother riding with higher-end Rockshox, FSA and Ritchey components, is what the R7 is all about.\n6061-T6 Series alloy 4-Bar Linkage frame, 125mm travel, Tapered 1.5\" head tube, 12mm Thru-Axle\nRockShox Monarch RL Solo Air rear shock w/ rebound adjuster & lock-out\nRockshox Recon Gold TK 27.5 fork, 1-1/8-1.5in Taper steerer, Solo Air, 120mm Travel, w/ 15mm Maxle thru-Axle\nRitchey Comp Logic Zero PF headset\nFSA Comet Compact crankset w/ 7075 alloy chainrings, 36/24T\nShimano Deore Side-swing front derailleur\nShimano Deore XT Shadow SGS rear derailleur\nShimano Deore 2x10 shifters, 11-34T cassette\nWTB Rocket Comp saddle\nRitchey Trail cockpit w/ Trail WCS Lock-Ring grips",
